<td>
<div align="justify"><font style="DISPLAY: inline; FONT-FAMILY: Times New Roman; FONT-SIZE: 10pt">it would be in the best interests of the Fund, as determined by the Board, for the Fund to repurchase such an Interest or portion thereof.</font></div>
