<div style="TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt" align="left"> <font style="DISPLAY: inline; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; FONT-SIZE: 10pt">(2) Of these accounts, [__] accounts with total assets of approximately $[_________] charge performance-based advisory fees.</font> </div>

